font/headscale/git/trees/4dae290ac6275c547aadd27bbcd0d9074ffcf754"},"message":"derp: use context-aware wait for STUN error rate limiting\n\nReplace time.Sleep with a select statement that respects context\ncancellation. This ensures the STUN server can shut down promptly\nwhen the context is cancelled, rather than blocking for up to\na second.","parents":[{"sha":"6c308fcfd4f06ad9265e7496d6de62a8788ab710","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/6c308fcfd4f06ad9265e7496d6de62a8788ab710","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/6c308fcfd4f06ad9265e7496d6de62a8788ab710"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgmMAoz5Zf+w0nAxyA6/zsNd95cP\n98YbtHIIXyy9A1sssAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQHDZH4ZWUGvqFnrQt0qjfuEwM11dDych7YAlM4+PN/Z32kuS57mFooSoM1E6I5lkRZ\nBAIkSBsLLVMxGYiLlhWA8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 4dae290ac6275c547aadd27bbcd0d9074ffcf754\nparent 6c308fcfd4f06ad9265e7496d6de62a8788ab710\nauthor Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@dalby.cc> 1765111474 +0000\ncommitter Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1765384593 +0100\n\nderp: use context-aware wait for STUN error rate limiting\n\nReplace time.Sleep with a select statement that respects context\ncancellation. This ensures the STUN server can shut down promptly\nwhen the context is cancelled, rather than blocking for up to\na second.\n","verified_at":"2025-12-10T16:40:52Z"},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"1a9ffba5b51a4f8adbeacfcc9c5c513102d97f1e","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDFhOWZmYmE1YjUxYTRmOGFkYmVhY2ZjYzljNWM1MTMxMDJkOTdmMWU","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/1a9ffba5b51a4f8adbeacfcc9c5c513102d97f1e","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/1a9ffba5b51a4f8adbeacfcc9c5c513102d97f1e","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2025-12-07T12:44:47Z"},"committe