tcher.IsConnected() to verify node connection state\n- Use atomic.LoadInt64() to check update counts\n\nThis makes the tests more robust and less prone to timing-related flakes.","parents":[{"sha":"437a0328c77df9a8b83ad58c08f370e7fb9cc157","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/437a0328c77df9a8b83ad58c08f370e7fb9cc157","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/437a0328c77df9a8b83ad58c08f370e7fb9cc157"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgmMAoz5Zf+w0nAxyA6/zsNd95cP\n98YbtHIIXyy9A1sssAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQL8wwJyWg2Ez9QCphioq83sLbWAkguAA2qUUc5T8xxeUYnoVTmYL/gKkXMlEEPXuI3\nQS8ZbPdUVO8rboHZf7+QA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 61bd3e79a890338240b9cf495b9304311e886057\nparent 437a0328c77df9a8b83ad58c08f370e7fb9cc157\nauthor Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@dalby.cc> 1765112713 +0000\ncommitter Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1765384848 +0100\n\nmapper: replace time.Sleep with proper synchronization in batcher tests\n\nReplace time.Sleep calls with proper synchronization primitives:\n- Use runtime.Gosched() for timing variability in chaos/concurrency tests\n- Use assert.EventuallyWithT to poll for expected state changes\n- Use batcher.IsConnected() to verify node connection state\n- Use atomic.LoadInt64() to check update counts\n\nThis makes the tests more robust and less prone to timing-related flakes.\n","verified_at":"2025-12-10T16:40:52Z"},"event":"committed"},{"id":21483807616,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz887cxXQuzwAAAAUAiOOA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/21483807616","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.g